One of the coldest moments in “Snowfall” (2017) comes during the jail phone call between Leon Simmons and Franklin Saint. When Franklin asks what he should do, Leon bluntly tells him to “grab the first n***a you see,” cutting through Franklin’s overthinking with a ruthless reminder of the survival mentality they grew up with. The line instantly became iconic because it perfectly captures Leon’s no-nonsense attitude while exposing the desperation and chaos surrounding Franklin’s downfall, turning a simple phone conversation into one of the series’ most unforgettable exchanges.

